; Safari answers session.subscribe with an empty result: {} where the spec requires the
; subscription id. Bindings that reject a missing required field fail the command, and with it
; session setup that subscribes, so relax the id to optional.
; Delete once Safari returns the subscription id.
; https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#command-session-subscribe
session.SubscribeResult = {
  ? subscription: session.Subscription,
}
